              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali endaalo eya saba eli endaalo eya sabato khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wowo. Khu ndaalo ng'eneyo okhakhola kumulimo kwosi kwosi tawe, obeele ewe, namwe omwana wowo omusoleeli namwe omukhaana, namwe nasioobi wowo owe siseecha namwe owe siikhasi, namwe chikhaafu chowo namwe omureende yesi yesi omenyile nawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
