        {
          "text": " Sikila khulwe chindaalo sita Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi akhola likulu ne liloba, enyanja ne bioosi bilimo mala aola khu ndaalo eya saba. Khwako Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi abiita chikhabi endaalo eya esabato mala aakitakaasa.",
