          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Okhekoomba enju eyo owasio tawe, okhekoomba omukhasi wewe tawe, akhaba nasioobi wewe owe siseecha namwe owe siikhasi, namwe eeyi yewe, epunda yewe, namwe sisiindu siosi siosi siili sisiewe, tawe.”",
