              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Baeb. 12.18-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Khwako babaandu boosi nga ne babona libalukha ne chimbeni ne ekhoombi ne yiipa, ne sikulu sie liliisi, baria mala baterema. Beema sinaao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baboolela Musa bali, “Ewe lomaloma khwifwe ne khulaulila. Ne kakhali okhalekha Wele aalomaloma khwifwe tawe. Ne busa khukhola khurio khwafwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Musa aboolela babaandu ali, “Mukharia tawe, sikila Wele echile khumukhaka enywe ne khumukhola muchiililile khumuria niye nio mukhakhola bubwoni tawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaandu bachiililila khukhwiima sinaao. Ne kakhali Musa eseenda siimbi a siilima sikali niio Wele aba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kamalaka khuloondekhana ne chi alutare",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aboolela Musa ali, “Boolela babaandu ba Isiraeli oli, ‘Mwaboone muli Ese, nalomaloome khwinywe khukhwama mwikulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhekholela mwabeene bawele be efwesa namwe esahabu ne mundubakho ese tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kholele Ese alutare eye liloba, mala mwoseliekho kamakheese kenywe ne chikhaafu chenywe nga biianwa bie khukhwosia ne biianwa bie kumuleembe. Buli abuundu niio namuroborera khulwe khukhusaaya, kheeche mwinywe mala mubiite chikhabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
